stStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" noProof="0"/><a:t>Document purpose</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="15" name="Text Placeholder 14"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{2C8C2871-0161-4EE9-C47C-A79024B94F11}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="23"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="576263" y="1435100"/><a:ext cx="3435350" cy="5136791"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Purpose</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>This guide defines the new </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="+mj-lt"/></a:rPr><a:t>Frontier Accelerate for Copilot: Envisioning &amp; Proof of Concept (POC) </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>engagement.  </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>This is a flexible pre-sales motion that helps customers move beyond AI features toward Frontier Transformation: re-inventing end-to-end business workflows with Microsoft 365 Copilot, agents, and Agent 365. The guide is structured around identifying high-value scenarios, building a defensible business case with measurable ROI, and proving value through a focused POC</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="19" name="Text Placeholder 18"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{7BF55526-4E55-4B6B-BFD4-661A7C614CD3}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/